# Frontend environment overrides.
#
# IMPORTANT: Vite inlines VITE_* at BUILD time, not run time. docker-compose
# supplies env_file at run time, so setting these in the root .env has no effect
# on the container image. To override in Docker you must pass them as build args
# (see frontend/Dockerfile).
#
# Every value below already defaults to a same-origin relative path that the
# immutable nginx.conf proxies correctly. You only need this file when running
# the frontend against services that are NOT behind that nginx — e.g. pointing a
# local `npm run dev` at a remote staging cluster.
#
# Leave everything commented out for the standard docker-compose setup.

# VITE_AUTH_API_URL=/api
# VITE_CHAT_API_URL=/chat/api
# VITE_GAME_API_URL=/tournaments
# VITE_CHAT_SOCKET_URL=https://localhost:8080
# VITE_CHAT_SOCKET_PATH=/chat/socket.io
